message: "If you use this code or these records, please cite the paper below."
title: "cnn-vit-robustness-protocols"
abstract: "Code, per-sample evaluation records, pre-registration documents and verification scripts for the paper 'Less a Weak Source than a Different One: Vulnerability, Similarity and Direction in CNN-ViT Adversarial Transfer under an Architecture-by-Initialization Design'. The paper factors log target-correct transfer rates between adversarially trained models into target vulnerability, symmetric similarity and a directional residual against a fixed panel of seven robust CNNs, and tests registered predictions in an architecture-by-initialization design on CIFAR-10, with CIFAR-100, ImageNetV2 and gradient-alignment addenda."
